			"notes": "## Kill Confirmed 2.0.0\n\nMajor ground-up rework with **zero library dependencies** (no RinLib, no Fabric API required) across an 8-target matrix (`1.20.1` Fabric/Forge, `1.21.1` / `26.1.2` / `26.2` Fabric/NeoForge).\n\n### Highlights\n- **Fire-Resistant Dog Tags (`kill_confirmed:dog_tag`)**: Survives fire and lava by default with a restrained 3-line epitaph (death message, automatic structure/biome landmark + coordinates, level & world day), right-click inspection chime, anti-farm cooldown, and `KillConfirmedApi.registerPlaceholder(...)`.\n- **108-Slot Vanilla Dog Tag Case (`kill_confirmed:dog_tag_case`)**: Dual-section `#C6C6C6` stone container with a `9×6` visible grid and native scrollbar over `9×12` (108) slots, real-time search bar, auto-pickup toggle, one-click sort (*Newest* / *By Victim* / *By Level*), casualty stats plaque, and bundle-style quick insert/extract.\n- **Acquisition & Config**: Craftable recipe, rare `8%` structure chest loot, and rare Wandering Trader offer; all configurable in `config/kill_confirmed.toml` or via the native in-game **Kill Confirmed Settings** screen."
		},
